theorem GlobalTheory.SW.weil_action : ∀ (E : Type) [Field E] [NumberField E] [IsCMField E] (Ψ : Finset (E →+* ℂ)), IsType Ψ → ∀ (n N : ℕ), Even n → ∀ γ ∈ UU E N, ∀ φ : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin N) E → ℂ, IsSB φ → IsSB (weil Ψ γ φ) ∧ TransH Ψ γ φ (weil Ψ γ φ) ∧ (∀ ψ, IsSB ψ → TransH Ψ γ φ ψ → ψ = weil Ψ γ φ) ∧ (∀ ψ, IsSB ψ → ip (weil Ψ γ φ) (weil Ψ γ ψ) = ip φ ψ ∧ weil Ψ γ (φ + ψ) = weil Ψ γ φ + weil Ψ γ ψ) ∧ (∀ c : ℂ, weil Ψ γ (c • φ) = c • weil Ψ γ φ) ∧ (∀ γ' ∈ UU E N, weil Ψ (γ' * γ) φ = weil Ψ γ' (weil Ψ γ φ)) ∧ weil Ψ 1 φ = φ := by sorry
